  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "At the busy airport terminal, an airplane waits outside the window. A baggage cart carries suitcases outside. A passenger carries a heavy bag and waits in line near the gate. There is an empty seat beside the line. A clock hangs above a screen. A woman in a uniform checks each ticket. A boy shows his ticket to her. His family is ready to board the airplane through the passage inside the airbridge.",
    "textZh": "在繁忙的機場航廈，一架飛機停在窗外等候。外面有一台行李拖車載運著行李箱。一位乘客提著沉重的旅行袋，在登機門附近排隊等候。隊伍旁邊有一個空座位。螢幕上方掛著一個時鐘。一位穿制服的女士核對每張票券。一個男孩向她出示票券。他的家人已準備好經由空橋內的通道登機。",
